        "id": 187,
        "title": "Repeated DNA Sequences",
        "category": "Sliding Window",
        "difficulty": "Medium",
        "description": "<p>The <strong>DNA sequence</strong> is composed of a series of nucleotides abbreviated as <code>&#39;A&#39;</code>, <code>&#39;C&#39;</code>, <code>&#39;G&#39;</code>, and <code>&#39;T&#39;</code>.</p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li>For example, <code>&quot;ACGAATTCCG&quot;</code> is a <strong>DNA sequence</strong>.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>When studying <strong>DNA</strong>, it is useful to identify repeated sequences within the DNA.</p>\n\n<p>Given a string <code>s</code> that represents a <strong>DNA sequence</strong>, return all the <strong><code>10</code>-letter-long</strong> sequences (substrings) that occur more than once in a DNA molecule. You may return the answer in <strong>any order</strong>.</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div style=\"font-weight: 600; font-size: 14px; color: #38bdf8; margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 8px;\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-code\" style=\"margin-right:6px;\"></i>Example 1:</div>\n<div style=\"background: #090d16; border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-left: 3px solid #38bdf8; border-radius: 6px; padding: 12px 16px; font-family: 'SFMono-Regular', Consolas, monospace; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 6px 0 16px 0; color: #e2e8f0;\"><div style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\"><span style=\"color: #94a3b8; font-weight: 600;\">Input:</span> <code style=\"color: #38bdf8; background: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.08); padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px;\">s = \"AAAAACCCCCAAAAACCCCCCAAAAAGGGTTT\"</code></div><div><span style=\"color: #94a3b8; font-weight: 600;\">Output:</span> <code style=\"color: #2ed573; background: rgba(46, 213, 115, 0.08); padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px;\">[\"AAAAACCCCC\",\"CCCCCAAAAA\"]</code></div></div><div style=\"font-weight: 600; font-size: 14px; color: #38bdf8; margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 8px;\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-code\" style=\"margin-right:6px;\"></i>Example 2:</div>\n<div style=\"background: #090d16; border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-left: 3px solid #38bdf8; border-radius: 6px; padding: 12px 16px; font-family: 'SFMono-Regular', Consolas, monospace; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 6px 0 16px 0; color: #e2e8f0;\"><div style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\"><span style=\"color: #94a3b8; font-weight: 600;\">Input:</span> <code style=\"color: #38bdf8; background: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.08); padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px;\">s = \"AAAAAAAAAAAAA\"</code></div><div><span style=\"color: #94a3b8; font-weight: 600;\">Output:</span> <code style=\"color: #2ed573; background: rgba(46, 213, 115, 0.08); padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px;\">[\"AAAAAAAAAA\"]</code></div></div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div style=\"font-weight: 700; font-size: 14px; color: #ffc01e; margin-top: 24px; margin-bottom: 10px;\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-triangle-exclamation\" style=\"margin-right:6px;\"></i>Constraints:</div>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li><code>1 &lt;= s.length &lt;= 10<sup>5</sup></code></li>\n\t<li><code>s[i]</code> is either <code>&#39;A&#39;</code>, <code>&#39;C&#39;</code>, <code>&#39;G&#39;</code>, or <code>&#39;T&#39;</code>.</li>\n</ul>",
