        "difficulty": "Easy",
        "description": "<div style=\"background: rgba(46, 213, 115, 0.08); border: 1px solid rgba(46, 213, 115, 0.25); border-left: 3px solid #2ed573; padding: 12px 16px; border-radius: 6px; margin-bottom: 20px; font-size: 13px; color: #cbd5e1;\"><strong style=\"color: #2ed573;\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-lightbulb\" style=\"margin-right:6px;\"></i>Beginner Tip:</strong> Halve the search space at each step by comparing your target against the middle element.</div><p>Reverse bits of a given 32 bits signed integer.</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div style=\"font-weight: 600; font-size: 14px; color: #38bdf8; margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 8px;\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-code\" style=\"margin-right:6px;\"></i>Example 1:</div>\n\n<div class=\"example-block\">\n<p><strong>Input:</strong> <span class=\"example-io\">n = 43261596</span></p>\n\n<p><strong>Output:</strong> <span class=\"example-io\">964176192</span></p>\n\n<p><strong>Explanation:</strong></p>\n\n<table>\n\t<tbody>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<th>Integer</th>\n\t\t\t<th>Binary</th>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td>43261596</td>\n\t\t\t<td>00000010100101000001111010011100</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td>964176192</td>\n\t\t\t<td>00111001011110000010100101000000</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"font-weight: 600; font-size: 14px; color: #38bdf8; margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 8px;\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-code\" style=\"margin-right:6px;\"></i>Example 2:</div>\n\n<div class=\"example-block\">\n<p><strong>Input:</strong> <span class=\"example-io\">n = 2147483644</span></p>\n\n<p><strong>Output:</strong> <span class=\"example-io\">1073741822</span></p>\n\n<p><strong>Explanation:</strong></p>\n\n<table>\n\t<tbody>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<th>Integer</th>\n\t\t\t<th>Binary</th>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td>2147483644</td>\n\t\t\t<td>01111111111111111111111111111100</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td>1073741822</td>\n\t\t\t<td>00111111111111111111111111111110</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div style=\"font-weight: 700; font-size: 14px; color: #ffc01e; margin-top: 24px; margin-bottom: 10px;\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-triangle-exclamation\" style=\"margin-right:6px;\"></i>Constraints:</div>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li><code>0 &lt;= n &lt;= 2<sup>31</sup> - 2</code></li>\n\t<li><code>n</code> is even.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><div style=\"font-weight: 700; font-size: 14px; color: #a855f7; margin-top: 24px; margin-bottom: 10px;\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-rocket\" style=\"margin-right:6px;\"></i>Follow-up Challenge:</div> If this function is called many times, how would you optimize it?</p>",
