        "id": 396,
        "title": "Rotate Function",
        "category": "Dynamic Programming",
        "difficulty": "Medium",
        "description": "<p>You are given an integer array <code>nums</code> of length <code>n</code>.</p>\n\n<p>Assume <code>arr<sub>k</sub></code> to be an array obtained by rotating <code>nums</code> by <code>k</code> positions clock-wise. We define the <strong>rotation function</strong> <code>F</code> on <code>nums</code> as follow:</p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li><code>F(k) = 0 * arr<sub>k</sub>[0] + 1 * arr<sub>k</sub>[1] + ... + (n - 1) * arr<sub>k</sub>[n - 1].</code></li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>Return <em>the maximum value of</em> <code>F(0), F(1), ..., F(n-1)</code>.</p>\n\n<p>The test cases are generated so that the answer fits in a <strong>32-bit</strong> integer.</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div style=\"font-weight: 600; font-size: 14px; color: #38bdf8; margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 8px;\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-code\" style=\"margin-right:6px;\"></i>Example 1:</div>\n\n<div style=\"background: #090d16; border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-left: 3px solid #38bdf8; border-radius: 6px; padding: 12px 16px; font-family: 'SFMono-Regular', Consolas, monospace; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 6px 0 16px 0; color: #e2e8f0;\"><div style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\"><span style=\"color: #94a3b8; font-weight: 600;\">Input:</span> <code style=\"color: #38bdf8; background: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.08); padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px;\">nums = [4,3,2,6]</code></div><div><span style=\"color: #94a3b8; font-weight: 600;\">Output:</span> <code style=\"color: #2ed573; background: rgba(46, 213, 115, 0.08); padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px;\">26</code></div><div style=\"color: #a1a1aa; font-size: 12px; font-family: sans-serif; margin-top: 8px; padding-top: 8px; border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);\"><b>Explanation:</b> F(0) = (0 * 4) + (1 * 3) + (2 * 2) + (3 * 6) = 0 + 3 + 4 + 18 = 25</div></div>\n\n<div style=\"font-weight: 600; font-size: 14px; color: #38bdf8; margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 8px;\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-code\" style=\"margin-right:6px;\"></i>Example 2:</div>\n\n<div style=\"background: #090d16; border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-left: 3px solid #38bdf8; border-radius: 6px; padding: 12px 16px; font-family: 'SFMono-Regular', Consolas, monospace; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 6px 0 16px 0; color: #e2e8f0;\"><div style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\"><span style=\"color: #94a3b8; font-weight: 600;\">Input:</span> <code style=\"color: #38bdf8; background: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.08); padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px;\">nums = [100]</code></div><div><span style=\"color: #94a3b8; font-weight: 600;\">Output:</span> <code style=\"color: #2ed573; background: rgba(46, 213, 115, 0.08); padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px;\">0</code></div></div>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div style=\"font-weight: 700; font-size: 14px; color: #ffc01e; margin-top: 24px; margin-bottom: 10px;\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-triangle-exclamation\" style=\"margin-right:6px;\"></i>Constraints:</div>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li><code>n == nums.length</code></li>\n\t<li><code>1 &lt;= n &lt;= 10<sup>5</sup></code></li>\n\t<li><code>-100 &lt;= nums[i] &lt;= 100</code></li>\n</ul>",
