            "Initialize two pointers positioned at opposite ends (0 and n-1) or moving in tandem (slow and fast pointers).",
            "Determine the pointer advancement logic based on comparing the current window or sum against the target condition.",
            "Ensure loop termination boundaries (left < right vs left <= right) correctly handle single-element or midpoint cases."
