        "id": 1026,
        "title": "Maximum Difference Between Node and Ancestor",
        "category": "Trees & Graphs",
        "difficulty": "Medium",
        "description": "<p>Given the <code>root</code> of a binary tree, find the maximum value <code>v</code> for which there exist <strong>different</strong> nodes <code>a</code> and <code>b</code> where <code>v = |a.val - b.val|</code> and <code>a</code> is an ancestor of <code>b</code>.</p>\n\n<p>A node <code>a</code> is an ancestor of <code>b</code> if either: any child of <code>a</code> is equal to <code>b</code>&nbsp;or any child of <code>a</code> is an ancestor of <code>b</code>.</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div style=\"font-weight: 600; font-size: 14px; color: #38bdf8; margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 8px;\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-code\" style=\"margin-right:6px;\"></i>Example 1:</div>\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://assets.leetcode.com/uploads/2020/11/09/tmp-tree.jpg\" style=\"width: 400px; height: 390px;\" />\n<div style=\"background: #090d16; border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-left: 3px solid #38bdf8; border-radius: 6px; padding: 12px 16px; font-family: 'SFMono-Regular', Consolas, monospace; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 6px 0 16px 0; color: #e2e8f0;\"><div style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\"><span style=\"color: #94a3b8; font-weight: 600;\">Input:</span> <code style=\"color: #38bdf8; background: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.08); padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px;\">root = [8,3,10,1,6,null,14,null,null,4,7,13]</code></div><div><span style=\"color: #94a3b8; font-weight: 600;\">Output:</span> <code style=\"color: #2ed573; background: rgba(46, 213, 115, 0.08); padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px;\">7</code></div></div>\n\n<div style=\"font-weight: 600; font-size: 14px; color: #38bdf8; margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 8px;\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-code\" style=\"margin-right:6px;\"></i>Example 2:</div>\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://assets.leetcode.com/uploads/2020/11/09/tmp-tree-1.jpg\" style=\"width: 250px; height: 349px;\" />\n<div style=\"background: #090d16; border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-left: 3px solid #38bdf8; border-radius: 6px; padding: 12px 16px; font-family: 'SFMono-Regular', Consolas, monospace; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 6px 0 16px 0; color: #e2e8f0;\"><div style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\"><span style=\"color: #94a3b8; font-weight: 600;\">Input:</span> <code style=\"color: #38bdf8; background: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.08); padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px;\">root = [1,null,2,null,0,3]</code></div><div><span style=\"color: #94a3b8; font-weight: 600;\">Output:</span> <code style=\"color: #2ed573; background: rgba(46, 213, 115, 0.08); padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px;\">3</code></div></div>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div style=\"font-weight: 700; font-size: 14px; color: #ffc01e; margin-top: 24px; margin-bottom: 10px;\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-triangle-exclamation\" style=\"margin-right:6px;\"></i>Constraints:</div>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li>The number of nodes in the tree is in the range <code>[2, 5000]</code>.</li>\n\t<li><code>0 &lt;= Node.val &lt;= 10<sup>5</sup></code></li>\n</ul>",
