        "category": "Dynamic Programming",
        "difficulty": "Medium",
        "description": "<p>You have <code>n</code> dice, and each dice has <code>k</code> faces numbered from <code>1</code> to <code>k</code>.</p>\n\n<p>Given three integers <code>n</code>, <code>k</code>, and <code>target</code>, return <em>the number of possible ways (out of the </em><code>k<sup>n</sup></code><em> total ways) </em><em>to roll the dice, so the sum of the face-up numbers equals </em><code>target</code>. Since the answer may be too large, return it <strong>modulo</strong> <code>10<sup>9</sup> + 7</code>.</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div style=\"font-weight: 600; font-size: 14px; color: #38bdf8; margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 8px;\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-code\" style=\"margin-right:6px;\"></i>Example 1:</div>\n\n<div style=\"background: #090d16; border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-left: 3px solid #38bdf8; border-radius: 6px; padding: 12px 16px; font-family: 'SFMono-Regular', Consolas, monospace; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 6px 0 16px 0; color: #e2e8f0;\"><div style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\"><span style=\"color: #94a3b8; font-weight: 600;\">Input:</span> <code style=\"color: #38bdf8; background: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.08); padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px;\">n = 1, k = 6, target = 3</code></div><div><span style=\"color: #94a3b8; font-weight: 600;\">Output:</span> <code style=\"color: #2ed573; background: rgba(46, 213, 115, 0.08); padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px;\">1</code></div><div style=\"color: #a1a1aa; font-size: 12px; font-family: sans-serif; margin-top: 8px; padding-top: 8px; border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);\"><b>Explanation:</b> You throw one die with 6 faces.</div></div>\n\n<div style=\"font-weight: 600; font-size: 14px; color: #38bdf8; margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 8px;\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-code\" style=\"margin-right:6px;\"></i>Example 2:</div>\n\n<div style=\"background: #090d16; border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-left: 3px solid #38bdf8; border-radius: 6px; padding: 12px 16px; font-family: 'SFMono-Regular', Consolas, monospace; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 6px 0 16px 0; color: #e2e8f0;\"><div style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\"><span style=\"color: #94a3b8; font-weight: 600;\">Input:</span> <code style=\"color: #38bdf8; background: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.08); padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px;\">n = 2, k = 6, target = 7</code></div><div><span style=\"color: #94a3b8; font-weight: 600;\">Output:</span> <code style=\"color: #2ed573; background: rgba(46, 213, 115, 0.08); padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px;\">6</code></div><div style=\"color: #a1a1aa; font-size: 12px; font-family: sans-serif; margin-top: 8px; padding-top: 8px; border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);\"><b>Explanation:</b> You throw two dice, each with 6 faces.</div></div>\n\n<div style=\"font-weight: 600; font-size: 14px; color: #38bdf8; margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 8px;\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-code\" style=\"margin-right:6px;\"></i>Example 3:</div>\n\n<div style=\"background: #090d16; border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-left: 3px solid #38bdf8; border-radius: 6px; padding: 12px 16px; font-family: 'SFMono-Regular', Consolas, monospace; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 6px 0 16px 0; color: #e2e8f0;\"><div style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\"><span style=\"color: #94a3b8; font-weight: 600;\">Input:</span> <code style=\"color: #38bdf8; background: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.08); padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px;\">n = 30, k = 30, target = 500</code></div><div><span style=\"color: #94a3b8; font-weight: 600;\">Output:</span> <code style=\"color: #2ed573; background: rgba(46, 213, 115, 0.08); padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px;\">222616187</code></div><div style=\"color: #a1a1aa; font-size: 12px; font-family: sans-serif; margin-top: 8px; padding-top: 8px; border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);\"><b>Explanation:</b> The answer must be returned modulo 10</div></div>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div style=\"font-weight: 700; font-size: 14px; color: #ffc01e; margin-top: 24px; margin-bottom: 10px;\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-triangle-exclamation\" style=\"margin-right:6px;\"></i>Constraints:</div>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li><code>1 &lt;= n, k &lt;= 30</code></li>\n\t<li><code>1 &lt;= target &lt;= 1000</code></li>\n</ul>",
