        "id": 1481,
        "title": "Least Number of Unique Integers after K Removals",
        "category": "Greedy & Math",
        "difficulty": "Medium",
        "description": "<p>Given an array of integers&nbsp;<code>arr</code>&nbsp;and an integer <code>k</code>.&nbsp;Find the <em>least number of unique integers</em>&nbsp;after removing <strong>exactly</strong> <code>k</code> elements<b>.</b></p>\r\n\r\n<ol>\r\n</ol>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<div style=\"font-weight: 600; font-size: 14px; color: #38bdf8; margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 8px;\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-code\" style=\"margin-right:6px;\"></i>Example 1:</div>\r\n\r\n<pre>\r\n<strong>Input: </strong>arr = [5,5,4], k = 1\r\n<strong>Output: </strong>1\r\n<strong>Explanation</strong>: Remove the single 4, only 5 is left.\r\n</pre>\r\n<div style=\"font-weight: 600; font-size: 14px; color: #38bdf8; margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 8px;\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-code\" style=\"margin-right:6px;\"></i>Example 2:</div>\r\n\r\n<pre>\r\n<strong>Input: </strong>arr = [4,3,1,1,3,3,2], k = 3\r\n<strong>Output: </strong>2\r\n<strong>Explanation</strong>: Remove 4, 2 and either one of the two 1s or three 3s. 1 and 3 will be left.</pre>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<div style=\"font-weight: 700; font-size: 14px; color: #ffc01e; margin-top: 24px; margin-bottom: 10px;\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-triangle-exclamation\" style=\"margin-right:6px;\"></i>Constraints:</div>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n\t<li><code>1 &lt;= arr.length&nbsp;&lt;= 10^5</code></li>\r\n\t<li><code>1 &lt;= arr[i] &lt;= 10^9</code></li>\r\n\t<li><code>0 &lt;= k&nbsp;&lt;= arr.length</code></li>\r\n</ul>",
