        "description": "<p>You are given three positive integers:&nbsp;<code>n</code>, <code>index</code>, and <code>maxSum</code>. You want to construct an array <code>nums</code> (<strong>0-indexed</strong>)<strong> </strong>that satisfies the following conditions:</p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li><code>nums.length == n</code></li>\n\t<li><code>nums[i]</code> is a <strong>positive</strong> integer where <code>0 &lt;= i &lt; n</code>.</li>\n\t<li><code>abs(nums[i] - nums[i+1]) &lt;= 1</code> where <code>0 &lt;= i &lt; n-1</code>.</li>\n\t<li>The sum of all the elements of <code>nums</code> does not exceed <code>maxSum</code>.</li>\n\t<li><code>nums[index]</code> is <strong>maximized</strong>.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>Return <code>nums[index]</code><em> of the constructed array</em>.</p>\n\n<p>Note that <code>abs(x)</code> equals <code>x</code> if <code>x &gt;= 0</code>, and <code>-x</code> otherwise.</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div style=\"font-weight: 600; font-size: 14px; color: #38bdf8; margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 8px;\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-code\" style=\"margin-right:6px;\"></i>Example 1:</div>\n\n<div style=\"background: #090d16; border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-left: 3px solid #38bdf8; border-radius: 6px; padding: 12px 16px; font-family: 'SFMono-Regular', Consolas, monospace; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 6px 0 16px 0; color: #e2e8f0;\"><div style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\"><span style=\"color: #94a3b8; font-weight: 600;\">Input:</span> <code style=\"color: #38bdf8; background: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.08); padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px;\">n = 4, index = 2,  maxSum = 6</code></div><div><span style=\"color: #94a3b8; font-weight: 600;\">Output:</span> <code style=\"color: #2ed573; background: rgba(46, 213, 115, 0.08); padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px;\">2</code></div><div style=\"color: #a1a1aa; font-size: 12px; font-family: sans-serif; margin-top: 8px; padding-top: 8px; border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);\"><b>Explanation:</b> nums = [1,2,</div></div>\n\n<div style=\"font-weight: 600; font-size: 14px; color: #38bdf8; margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 8px;\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-code\" style=\"margin-right:6px;\"></i>Example 2:</div>\n\n<div style=\"background: #090d16; border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-left: 3px solid #38bdf8; border-radius: 6px; padding: 12px 16px; font-family: 'SFMono-Regular', Consolas, monospace; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 6px 0 16px 0; color: #e2e8f0;\"><div style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\"><span style=\"color: #94a3b8; font-weight: 600;\">Input:</span> <code style=\"color: #38bdf8; background: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.08); padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px;\">n = 6, index = 1,  maxSum = 10</code></div><div><span style=\"color: #94a3b8; font-weight: 600;\">Output:</span> <code style=\"color: #2ed573; background: rgba(46, 213, 115, 0.08); padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px;\">3</code></div></div>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div style=\"font-weight: 700; font-size: 14px; color: #ffc01e; margin-top: 24px; margin-bottom: 10px;\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-triangle-exclamation\" style=\"margin-right:6px;\"></i>Constraints:</div>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li><code>1 &lt;= n &lt;= maxSum &lt;= 10<sup>9</sup></code></li>\n\t<li><code>0 &lt;= index &lt; n</code></li>\n</ul>",
