        "id": 2096,
        "title": "Step-By-Step Directions From a Binary Tree Node to Another",
        "category": "Trees & Graphs",
        "difficulty": "Medium",
        "description": "<p>You are given the <code>root</code> of a <strong>binary tree</strong> with <code>n</code> nodes. Each node is uniquely assigned a value from <code>1</code> to <code>n</code>. You are also given an integer <code>startValue</code> representing the value of the start node <code>s</code>, and a different integer <code>destValue</code> representing the value of the destination node <code>t</code>.</p>\n\n<p>Find the <strong>shortest path</strong> starting from node <code>s</code> and ending at node <code>t</code>. Generate step-by-step directions of such path as a string consisting of only the <strong>uppercase</strong> letters <code>&#39;L&#39;</code>, <code>&#39;R&#39;</code>, and <code>&#39;U&#39;</code>. Each letter indicates a specific direction:</p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li><code>&#39;L&#39;</code> means to go from a node to its <strong>left child</strong> node.</li>\n\t<li><code>&#39;R&#39;</code> means to go from a node to its <strong>right child</strong> node.</li>\n\t<li><code>&#39;U&#39;</code> means to go from a node to its <strong>parent</strong> node.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>Return <em>the step-by-step directions of the <strong>shortest path</strong> from node </em><code>s</code><em> to node</em> <code>t</code>.</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div style=\"font-weight: 600; font-size: 14px; color: #38bdf8; margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 8px;\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-code\" style=\"margin-right:6px;\"></i>Example 1:</div>\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://assets.leetcode.com/uploads/2021/11/15/eg1.png\" style=\"width: 214px; height: 163px;\" />\n<div style=\"background: #090d16; border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-left: 3px solid #38bdf8; border-radius: 6px; padding: 12px 16px; font-family: 'SFMono-Regular', Consolas, monospace; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 6px 0 16px 0; color: #e2e8f0;\"><div style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\"><span style=\"color: #94a3b8; font-weight: 600;\">Input:</span> <code style=\"color: #38bdf8; background: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.08); padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px;\">root = [5,1,2,3,null,6,4], startValue = 3, destValue = 6</code></div><div><span style=\"color: #94a3b8; font-weight: 600;\">Output:</span> <code style=\"color: #2ed573; background: rgba(46, 213, 115, 0.08); padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px;\">&quot;UURL&quot;</code></div><div style=\"color: #a1a1aa; font-size: 12px; font-family: sans-serif; margin-top: 8px; padding-top: 8px; border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);\"><b>Explanation:</b> The shortest path is: 3 &rarr; 1 &rarr; 5 &rarr; 2 &rarr; 6.</div></div>\n\n<div style=\"font-weight: 600; font-size: 14px; color: #38bdf8; margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 8px;\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-code\" style=\"margin-right:6px;\"></i>Example 2:</div>\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://assets.leetcode.com/uploads/2021/11/15/eg2.png\" style=\"width: 74px; height: 102px;\" />\n<div style=\"background: #090d16; border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-left: 3px solid #38bdf8; border-radius: 6px; padding: 12px 16px; font-family: 'SFMono-Regular', Consolas, monospace; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 6px 0 16px 0; color: #e2e8f0;\"><div style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\"><span style=\"color: #94a3b8; font-weight: 600;\">Input:</span> <code style=\"color: #38bdf8; background: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.08); padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px;\">root = [2,1], startValue = 2, destValue = 1</code></div><div><span style=\"color: #94a3b8; font-weight: 600;\">Output:</span> <code style=\"color: #2ed573; background: rgba(46, 213, 115, 0.08); padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px;\">&quot;L&quot;</code></div><div style=\"color: #a1a1aa; font-size: 12px; font-family: sans-serif; margin-top: 8px; padding-top: 8px; border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);\"><b>Explanation:</b> The shortest path is: 2 &rarr; 1.</div></div>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div style=\"font-weight: 700; font-size: 14px; color: #ffc01e; margin-top: 24px; margin-bottom: 10px;\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-triangle-exclamation\" style=\"margin-right:6px;\"></i>Constraints:</div>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li>The number of nodes in the tree is <code>n</code>.</li>\n\t<li><code>2 &lt;= n &lt;= 10<sup>5</sup></code></li>\n\t<li><code>1 &lt;= Node.val &lt;= n</code></li>\n\t<li>All the values in the tree are <strong>unique</strong>.</li>\n\t<li><code>1 &lt;= startValue, destValue &lt;= n</code></li>\n\t<li><code>startValue != destValue</code></li>\n</ul>",
