        "title": "Sum of Scores of Built Strings",
        "category": "Binary Search",
        "difficulty": "Hard",
        "description": "<p>You are <strong>building</strong> a string <code>s</code> of length <code>n</code> <strong>one</strong> character at a time, <strong>prepending</strong> each new character to the <strong>front</strong> of the string. The strings are labeled from <code>1</code> to <code>n</code>, where the string with length <code>i</code> is labeled <code>s<sub>i</sub></code>.</p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li>For example, for <code>s = &quot;abaca&quot;</code>, <code>s<sub>1</sub> == &quot;a&quot;</code>, <code>s<sub>2</sub> == &quot;ca&quot;</code>, <code>s<sub>3</sub> == &quot;aca&quot;</code>, etc.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>The <strong>score</strong> of <code>s<sub>i</sub></code> is the length of the <strong>longest common prefix</strong> between <code>s<sub>i</sub></code> and <code>s<sub>n</sub></code> (Note that <code>s == s<sub>n</sub></code>).</p>\n\n<p>Given the final string <code>s</code>, return<em> the <strong>sum</strong> of the <strong>score</strong> of every </em><code>s<sub>i</sub></code>.</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div style=\"font-weight: 600; font-size: 14px; color: #38bdf8; margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 8px;\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-code\" style=\"margin-right:6px;\"></i>Example 1:</div>\n\n<div style=\"background: #090d16; border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-left: 3px solid #38bdf8; border-radius: 6px; padding: 12px 16px; font-family: 'SFMono-Regular', Consolas, monospace; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 6px 0 16px 0; color: #e2e8f0;\"><div style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\"><span style=\"color: #94a3b8; font-weight: 600;\">Input:</span> <code style=\"color: #38bdf8; background: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.08); padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px;\">s = &quot;babab&quot;</code></div><div><span style=\"color: #94a3b8; font-weight: 600;\">Output:</span> <code style=\"color: #2ed573; background: rgba(46, 213, 115, 0.08); padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px;\">9</code></div><div style=\"color: #a1a1aa; font-size: 12px; font-family: sans-serif; margin-top: 8px; padding-top: 8px; border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);\"><b>Explanation:</b> For s</div></div>\n\n<div style=\"font-weight: 600; font-size: 14px; color: #38bdf8; margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 8px;\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-code\" style=\"margin-right:6px;\"></i>Example 2:</div>\n\n<div style=\"background: #090d16; border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-left: 3px solid #38bdf8; border-radius: 6px; padding: 12px 16px; font-family: 'SFMono-Regular', Consolas, monospace; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 6px 0 16px 0; color: #e2e8f0;\"><div style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\"><span style=\"color: #94a3b8; font-weight: 600;\">Input:</span> <code style=\"color: #38bdf8; background: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.08); padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px;\">s = &quot;azbazbzaz&quot;</code></div><div><span style=\"color: #94a3b8; font-weight: 600;\">Output:</span> <code style=\"color: #2ed573; background: rgba(46, 213, 115, 0.08); padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px;\">14</code></div><div style=\"color: #a1a1aa; font-size: 12px; font-family: sans-serif; margin-top: 8px; padding-top: 8px; border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);\"><b>Explanation:</b> For s</div></div>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div style=\"font-weight: 700; font-size: 14px; color: #ffc01e; margin-top: 24px; margin-bottom: 10px;\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-triangle-exclamation\" style=\"margin-right:6px;\"></i>Constraints:</div>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li><code>1 &lt;= s.length &lt;= 10<sup>5</sup></code></li>\n\t<li><code>s</code> consists of lowercase English letters.</li>\n</ul>",
