        "title": "Optimal Partition of String",
        "category": "String Algorithms",
        "difficulty": "Medium",
        "description": "<p>Given a string <code>s</code>, partition the string into one or more <strong>substrings</strong> such that the characters in each substring are <strong>unique</strong>. That is, no letter appears in a single substring more than <strong>once</strong>.</p>\n\n<p>Return <em>the <strong>minimum</strong> number of substrings in such a partition.</em></p>\n\n<p>Note that each character should belong to exactly one substring in a partition.</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div style=\"font-weight: 600; font-size: 14px; color: #38bdf8; margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 8px;\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-code\" style=\"margin-right:6px;\"></i>Example 1:</div>\n\n<div style=\"background: #090d16; border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-left: 3px solid #38bdf8; border-radius: 6px; padding: 12px 16px; font-family: 'SFMono-Regular', Consolas, monospace; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 6px 0 16px 0; color: #e2e8f0;\"><div style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\"><span style=\"color: #94a3b8; font-weight: 600;\">Input:</span> <code style=\"color: #38bdf8; background: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.08); padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px;\">s = &quot;abacaba&quot;</code></div><div><span style=\"color: #94a3b8; font-weight: 600;\">Output:</span> <code style=\"color: #2ed573; background: rgba(46, 213, 115, 0.08); padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px;\">4</code></div><div style=\"color: #a1a1aa; font-size: 12px; font-family: sans-serif; margin-top: 8px; padding-top: 8px; border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);\"><b>Explanation:</b> Two possible partitions are (&quot;a&quot;,&quot;ba&quot;,&quot;cab&quot;,&quot;a&quot;) and (&quot;ab&quot;,&quot;a&quot;,&quot;ca&quot;,&quot;ba&quot;).</div></div>\n\n<div style=\"font-weight: 600; font-size: 14px; color: #38bdf8; margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 8px;\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-code\" style=\"margin-right:6px;\"></i>Example 2:</div>\n\n<div style=\"background: #090d16; border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-left: 3px solid #38bdf8; border-radius: 6px; padding: 12px 16px; font-family: 'SFMono-Regular', Consolas, monospace; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 6px 0 16px 0; color: #e2e8f0;\"><div style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\"><span style=\"color: #94a3b8; font-weight: 600;\">Input:</span> <code style=\"color: #38bdf8; background: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.08); padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px;\">s = &quot;ssssss&quot;</code></div><div><span style=\"color: #94a3b8; font-weight: 600;\">Output:</span> <code style=\"color: #2ed573; background: rgba(46, 213, 115, 0.08); padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px;\">6</code></div></div>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div style=\"font-weight: 700; font-size: 14px; color: #ffc01e; margin-top: 24px; margin-bottom: 10px;\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-triangle-exclamation\" style=\"margin-right:6px;\"></i>Constraints:</div>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li><code>1 &lt;= s.length &lt;= 10<sup>5</sup></code></li>\n\t<li><code>s</code> consists of only English lowercase letters.</li>\n</ul>",
